# Registration backend (Supabase). Browser-safe values ONLY.
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in the project URL
# (https://<project-ref>.supabase.co) and the public anon key. For deployed
# builds, set the same two variables in the hosting provider's project
# settings (e.g. Vercel -> Settings -> Environment Variables): VITE_* values
# are baked in at build time.
#
# VITE_* variables are bundled into public JavaScript — never put the
# service_role key or any other secret here. The Edge Functions read their
# own secrets (SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, QR_VERIFY_BASE_URL, RESEND_API_KEY…)
# from Supabase function secrets, not from this file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
